<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 11 trln rbls in T-bills May 21.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 11 trln rbls in T-bills May 21.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will auction four trillion roubles in 168-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 22084) and seven trillion roubles in 364-day T-bills (series 23007) on May 21, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the series 22084 issue:</p>
<p>    Series number			  22084</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			     May 21, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				    168 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			  Nov 5, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the series 23007 issue:</p>
<p>    Series number			  23007</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   7.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			     May 21, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				    364 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			  May 20, 1998</p>
<p>On May 21 the Finance Ministry will also repay seven trillion roubles in a maturing issue of 238-day T-bills (series 22051).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
